{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-12","kind":"proposition","title":"从线外一点向直线作垂线","englishTitle":"To a given infinite straight line, from a given point which is not on it, to draw a perpendicular straight line.","book":1,"number":12,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.12","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.12/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":12,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-12@raw-f6b99da25119155f","contentId":"euclid-1-12","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f6b99da25119155f270f0bbdb8ac13c9b6ccee4dc091444527faff8e5ca3b8d1","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-12.statement","euclid-1-12.construction.1","euclid-1-12.construction.2","euclid-1-12.proof.1","euclid-1-12.proof.2","euclid-1-12.proof.3","euclid-1-12.proof.4","euclid-1-12.conclusion","euclid-1-12.historical.1","euclid-1-12.historical.2","euclid-1-12.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-12.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-12","revisionId":"euclid-1-12@raw-f6b99da25119155f","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"83d089d385185237f22308c844d55bbc3bc3347c2ac6edd5fce75815eb3c2d00","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To a given infinite straight line, from a given point which is not on it, to draw a perpendicular straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"至给定的无限直线, 从一个不在上面的点, 绘制直线垂直 。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"有无界直线，线外有一点，求于点上作垂线至直线上。"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"给定一条可以无限延长的直线和直线外一点，过这个点向该直线作垂线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-12.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-12","revisionId":"euclid-1-12@raw-f6b99da25119155f","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fccea72b1a33b2f3a2bbe9fba25ae5027cdd07b0b1b4b6e8ce282261d6e05921","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be the given infinite straight line, and C the given point which is not on it; thus it is required to draw to the given infinite straight line AB, from the given point C which is not on it, a perpendicular straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB线成为给定的无限直线,让C没有的点成为给定的无穷直线AB线,因此,它必须从给定的不在其中的C点上划出一条直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-12.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-1-12","revisionId":"euclid-1-12@raw-f6b99da25119155f","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2eb2bb8e8c557d2ac5d42df2fe75f0abe41a39d8687db51aaa66b186264ce45e","citations":["euclid-1-post-3","euclid-1-10","euclid-1-post-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let a point D be taken at random on the other side of the straight line AB, and with centre C and distance CD let the circle EFG be described; [[Post. 3](/principles/euclid-1-post-3)] let the straight line EG be bisected at H, [[I. 10](/principles/euclid-1-10)] and let the straight lines CG, CH, CE be joined. [[Post. 1](/principles/euclid-1-post-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将D点随机地放在AB线另一侧,以C中点和CD中点和距离来说明EFG圆;将EG线线在H处两分为二,将CG、CH、CE直线连接。 [[Post. 3](/principles/euclid-1-post-3)] [[I. 10](/principles/euclid-1-10)] [[Post. 1](/principles/euclid-1-post-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-12.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-12","revisionId":"euclid-1-12@raw-f6b99da25119155f","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cd782ca1fb686b6703854d60e6fcc9a0cfd36925a8ac29cb1338cf2f0152f91f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that CH has been drawn perpendicular to the given infinite straight line AB from the given point C which is not on it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,CH线与C线的无穷直线是垂直的,而CH线不是在这条线上。（相关点与线段：AB）"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-12.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-12","revisionId":"euclid-1-12@raw-f6b99da25119155f","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b2c538ad18d7211fc200c2ec5a2cc659a10adab8b488415ca87d0104c6b9998a","citations":["euclid-1-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since GH is equal to HE, and HC is common, the two sides GH, HC are equal to the two sides EH, HC respectively; and the base CG is equal to the base CE; therefore the angle CHG is equal to the angle EHC. [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)] And they are adjacent angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为GH等于HE,HC是常见的,双方GH,HC等于双方EH,HC;底边,CG等于底边,CE;因此,CHG角等于EHC角,它们是相邻的角。 [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-12.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-12","revisionId":"euclid-1-12@raw-f6b99da25119155f","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3823868b8d478b4b129703316be415bf285a13de23cd21affe85d560ca0c76f9","citations":["euclid-1-def-10"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, when a straight line set up on a straight line makes the adjacent angles equal to one another, each of the equal angles is right, and the straight line standing on the other is called a perpendicular to that on which it stands. [[Def. 10](/principles/euclid-1-def-10)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,当一条直线固定在一条直线上,使相邻的角等同于另一条直线时,各等角度是正的,站在另一条直线上,直线就被称为直直线,直线与直线所持的直线相容。 [[Def. 10](/principles/euclid-1-def-10)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-12.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-12","revisionId":"euclid-1-12@raw-f6b99da25119155f","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"be82cfd3a93cea6f20ba3acfa634ba625de76987eb17ef9cd4009ca9d185157c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore CH has been drawn perpendicular to the given infinite straight line AB from the given point C which is not on it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,从C点(未标注的点)划出CH线,与给定的无限直线AB直线直径直切。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-12.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-12","revisionId":"euclid-1-12@raw-f6b99da25119155f","order":7,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6e432e38b0000ec6ee99e2e8d764f4fbbb98aaaef6b326a175b8cd06205cc0c2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"所求作图完成。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-12.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-12","revisionId":"euclid-1-12@raw-f6b99da25119155f","order":8,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8105801cde2584734e6b1f351cdb97b0553083ef8ee3f4b5adef7172d0dc1be0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"有无界直线，线外有一点，求于点上作垂线至直线上。"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"给定一条可以无限延长的直线和直线外一点，过这个点向该直线作垂线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-12.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-12","revisionId":"euclid-1-12@raw-f6b99da25119155f","order":9,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9cab15c850dfa43409d2b55707410075c71cbe0c32ce0985e32bdbfdab22c5e4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：丙己丁、丙己戊两角形之丙丁、丙戊两线等，丙己同线，则“丙戊己”与“丙丁己”两角必等〈本篇八〉，而“丁丙己”与“戊丙己”两角又等，则“丙己丁”与“丙己戊”等皆直角〈本篇四〉，而丙己定为垂线矣。"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：丙己丁、丙己戊两三角形之丙丁、丙戊两线等，丙己同线，则“丙戊己”与“丙丁己”两角必等〈本篇八〉，而“丁丙己”与“戊丙己”两角又等，则“丙己丁”与“丙己戊”等皆直角〈本篇四〉，而丙己定为垂线矣。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-12.source","contentId":"euclid-1-12","revisionId":"euclid-1-12@raw-f6b99da25119155f","order":10,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fa0c26e459b9d2d25e46b4221ea5ff625b345b42756e470432dbc1064b45ee4c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.12/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.12\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-1-12:euclid-1-post-3:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-12","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-12.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-post-3","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis